      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZARA'S SECRET (2) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 18.01 beating Control Bubba. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Great chance again. DIRTY DANCING (4) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (18.42) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. KELMAR BOSS (5) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on her speedy win the start prior, getting around this track over 383m in 22.33. Should be in this for a long way. TEN A PENNY (8) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
